 "remarks": "Welcome to 1 Walter Avenue, Unit 36, where comfortable living and everyday convenience come together in Norwalk's Wolfpit neighborhood. This inviting one bedroom, one bathroom Ranch style condominium offers a thoughtfully arranged single level layout filled with natural light. The spacious living room features wall to wall carpeting, a neutral color palette, and a large picture window overlooking mature trees. The adjoining dining area flows into a galley kitchen featuring crisp white Shaker cabinetry, brushed metal hardware, tile flooring, ample counter space, and a gas range. The generously sized bedroom offers a peaceful retreat with carpeting, a large window, and a spacious closet. Wall mounted air conditioning units in both the living room and bedroom provide added comfort during the warmer months. The full bathroom features a glass enclosed shower with classic subway tile, decorative mosaic accents, a built in corner seat, and a pedestal sink. Heat, hot water, and one parking space are included in the rent. Onsite laundry and association provided grounds maintenance, snow removal, and trash pickup add to the ease of everyday living. Ideally situated near downtown Norwalk, local shops, restaurants, area beaches, and I-95, this unfurnished rental offers convenient access to everything the area has to offer. Discover a welcoming place to call home at 1 Walter Avenue! Landlord is a licensed real estate agent.",
